{"id":"599d9af24f7e091a","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-functionalequation.md","title":"Functional equations, evaluation, and satisfaction","display":"df-functionalequation — Functional equations, evaluation, and satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-functionalequation","aliases":["27-df-functionalequation"],"display":"df-functionalequation — Functional equations, evaluation, and satisfaction","depends_on":["[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]","[[27-df-boolexpr]]","[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§11.2 Definition 11.2 and satisfaction semantics","source_printed_pages":"489–490","source_pdf_pages":"513–514","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-explicit-syntax-and-semantics"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-functionalequation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-functionalequation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-functionalequation — Functional equations, evaluation, and satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ea7333297b3209a\" href=\"?note=6ea7333297b3209a\" title=\"27-df-vectorinterpretation\">27-df-vectorinterpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.2 Definition 11.2 and satisfaction semantics"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"489–490"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"513–514"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-explicit-syntax-and-semantics"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,s\\geq1\">\\(m,s\\geq1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq0\">\\(n\\geq0\\)</span> 为整数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_r\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6ea7333297b3209a\" href=\"?note=6ea7333297b3209a\" title=\"27-df-vectorinterpretation\">27-df-vectorinterpretation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_s\">\\(h\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_s\\)</span>；有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m^{[s]}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m^{[s]}\\)</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 项记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_i\">\\(\\tau_i\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m\">\\(Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 是单射元组编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=\\langle m,p,q\\rangle\">\\(e=\\langle m,p,q\\rangle\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\)</span> 是等式左右两侧的语法对象，其载体由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\geq1}\\left(\\{s\\}\\times\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_s\\times\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m^{[s]}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\geq1}\\left(\\{s\\}\\times\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_s\\times\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m^{[s]}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FEq}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,p,q\\rangle\\mid m\\geq1,\\ p,q\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\},\\qquad \\nu(\\langle m,p,q\\rangle)\\coloneqq m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FEq}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,p,q\\rangle\\mid m\\geq1,\\ p,q\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\},\\qquad \\nu(\\langle m,p,q\\rangle)\\coloneqq m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}:\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\times\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times(\\mathbb B^n)^m\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}:\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\times\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times(\\mathbb B^n)^m\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(\\langle s,h,\\tau\\rangle,f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_s(h)\\left(\\left(f\\left(\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\tau_i)(Y)\\right)\\right)_{i\\in[s]}\\right)\\quad(\\langle s,h,\\tau\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(\\langle s,h,\\tau\\rangle,f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_s(h)\\left(\\left(f\\left(\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\tau_i)(Y)\\right)\\right)_{i\\in[s]}\\right)\\quad(\\langle s,h,\\tau\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_{e,n},R_{e,n}:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_{e,n},R_{e,n}:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(p,f,Y),\\qquad R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(q,f,Y)\\quad(e=\\langle m,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{FEq}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(p,f,Y),\\qquad R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(q,f,Y)\\quad(e=\\langle m,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{FEq}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\models_n e\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;\\left(L_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\models_n e\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;\\left(L_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.2、式 (11.3) 及紧接的满足关系，印刷 pp.489–490／PDF pp.513–514；已逐项核对，并查看这两页图像核实等式结构。左右侧可有不同调用次数 s、t，但必须共享向量变量数 m。每次 f 的输入由一个 m 元表达式逐坐标解释得到，仍是 n 维向量；外层 h 只接收布尔输出。</p>\n<p>这是有限语法对象，而非未经解释的“方程谓词”：各侧唯一解构，FEVal 是已有全函数的有限复合，所以值唯一且为 0 或 1。式中没有嵌套调用 f(f(…))，没有变元取负或取常元的隐含代换规则。n=0 时赋值空间仍有唯一元素，满足关系不是空全称。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-vectorinterpretation","status":"resolved","id":"6ea7333297b3209a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vectorinterpretation","status":"resolved","id":"6ea7333297b3209a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,s\\geq1$、$n\\geq0$ 为整数；$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r$、$\\mathrm{Eval}_r$ 与 $\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$ 见 [[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]。$h\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_s$；有限序列 $\\tau\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m^{[s]}$ 的第 $i$ 项记作 $\\tau_i$。取 $f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$；$\\langle\\cdot\\rangle$ 是单射元组编码。$e=\\langle m,p,q\\rangle$ 时，$p,q\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m$ 是等式左右两侧的语法对象，其载体由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m,s\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eval}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m^{[s]}","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_i","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"e=\\langle m,p,q\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\geq1}\\left(\\{s\\}\\times\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_s\\times\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_m^{[s]}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FEq}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,p,q\\rangle\\mid m\\geq1,\\ p,q\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\},\\qquad \\nu(\\langle m,p,q\\rangle)\\coloneqq m.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}:\\mathrm{FESide}_m\\times\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times(\\mathbb B^n)^m\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(\\langle s,h,\\tau\\rangle,f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Eval}_s(h)\\left(\\left(f\\left(\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}(\\tau_i)(Y)\\right)\\right)_{i\\in[s]}\\right)\\quad(\\langle s,h,\\tau\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{FESide}_m).","display":true},{"tex":"L_{e,n},R_{e,n}:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\longrightarrow\\mathbb B\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}).","display":true},{"tex":"L_{e,n}(f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(p,f,Y),\\qquad R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FEVal}_{m,n}(q,f,Y)\\quad(e=\\langle m,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{FEq}).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\models_n e\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\forall Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^{\\nu(e)}\\;\\left(L_{e,n}(f,Y)=R_{e,n}(f,Y)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":3048,"backlinks":[{"id":"6afd580565e13acf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FEq}$ 与 $\\models_n$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]；$I\\subseteq\\mathrm{FEq}$。$\\mathcal U_+$ 是本节点构造的正元数布尔函数全集；$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$。$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]；对任意集合 $A$，本节构造有限子集集合 $\\mathrm{Fin}(A)$ 与模型集合 $\\mathrm{Mod}_+(I)$，并定义二元谓词 $\\mathrm{Char}_+$ 及一元谓词 $\\mathrm{EqDef}_+$、$\\mathrm{FinEqDef}_+$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-functionalequation|df-functionalequation — Functional equations, evaluation, and satisfaction]]"},{"id":"f1791ff3e14b4575","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"可追踪的内部入口依次为 [[27-df-functionalequation]] 与 [[27-df-equationalclass]]，[[27-df-fiterror]] 与 [[27-df-bestfit]]，[[27-df-missingbits]] 与 [[27-df-missingextensions]]，以及 [[27-df-pbextension]]、[[27-df-pbmaxelim]]。它们的完整数学条件仍由各自的 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 给出，本摘要不增加新的数学前提。"},{"id":"1d6715331cf48592","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$、$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$r\\geq1$ 为整数。$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]；$\\mathrm{FEq}$、$\\models_n$、$X_i^{(r)}$ 及语法的 $\\neg,\\wedge,\\vee$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]。$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$、$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$、$\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-thm-hornfunctional]]、[[27-thm-affinechar]]。有限语法析取由下节递归构造；$\\langle\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_s\\rangle$ 代表以 $[s]$ 为域的表达式序列，$\\langle\\tau_1\\rangle$ 是长度为1的序列。"},{"id":"b2aa62f1a3d9ec85","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$；$\\mathrm{EqDef}_+$、$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$、$\\mathrm{Id}_r$、$\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]；$\\models_n$、$\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$ 分别见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]、[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]。"},{"id":"7ef17f865bf13a3e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$；$\\mathrm{Char}_+$、$\\mathrm{FinEqDef}_+$、$K_n$ 见 [[27-df-equationalclass]]；$\\nu$、$\\mathrm{FEq}$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]；$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]；$\\mathrm{NonMemberCert}_n$、$\\mathrm{BoundedCert}_+$ 见 [[27-df-nonmembershipcertificate]]。$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 为 [[27-df-boolfunc]] 的函数集合，$\\mathrm{Fin}(A)$ 为 [[27-df-equationalclass]] 的有限子集集合。对有限方程集 $I$，$c_I$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"037ae69d6e2ef1cf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$，$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$e=\\langle m,\\langle s,h,\\tau\\rangle,\\langle t,h',\\rho\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{FEq}$，$g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$。$\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n},L_{e,n},R_{e,n},\\models_n$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]，$\\mathrm{NonMemberCert}_n,K_n$ 见 [[27-df-nonmembershipcertificate]]。假定 $\\forall f\\in K_n\\;(f\\models_n e)$。"},{"id":"9f83e5a1d0632c23","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}$、$\\nu(e)=m$，$g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$ 且 $L_{e,n}(g,Y)\\ne R_{e,n}(g,Y)$。方程求值见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]；$\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q},\\mathrm{Id}_r$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]。列向量 $C_i$、列型数 $q$、合法编号集合 $\\mathcal R_Y$ 及各编号对应的压缩赋值 $Y^{(r)}$ 由下式构造。"},{"id":"ec427db58f9f0869","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$L_{e,n}$、$R_{e,n}$ 与 $\\nu(e)$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]。对布尔标量 $a,b$，$a\\vee b=\\max(a,b)$、$a\\wedge b=\\min(a,b)$。"}],"outgoing":["6ea7333297b3209a","f3101a1c9df92f67","5d10aed668d85817"]}